{"availability":"available","full":"jdx/jactionlint","name":"jactionlint","description":":octocat: Static checker for GitHub Actions workflow files","category":"Other","language":"Go","stars":242,"forks":2,"created":"2026-10-05T00:42:21Z","updated":"2026-10-14T18:32:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jactionlint.jdx.dev","topics":[],"demo":"https://jactionlint.jdx.dev/playground","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.105Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.105Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.105Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.105Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:19:03.276Z","stars":140,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:25:57.069Z","stars":184,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:25:48.218Z","stars":206,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.105Z","stars":242,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Catch broken and insecure GitHub Actions workflows before they run.","Documentation · Playground · Rules · Changelog","jactionlint is a static checker for GitHub Actions. It reads your workflows, composite actions and dependabot.yml and reports two kinds of problems: the mistakes that make a run fail or misbehave, and the patterns that let an outsider run code in your repository or steal its token. It started as a fork of actionlint and covers its checks, and its security rules follow the audits of zizmor."],"features":["Correctness. Unknown keys and events, type errors in ${{ }} expressions, wrong inputs of actions and reusable workflows, and broken needs:, cron and glob patterns. shellcheck and pyflakes check the scripts of run: steps.","Security. Script injection, excessive token permissions, dangerous triggers such as pullrequesttarget, cache poisoning, credentials left in the checkout and AI agent actions that outsiders can steer.","Policy. Actions used by a tag instead of a commit, and workflows without permissions:, a job timeout or a concurrency group.","Fixes. jactionlint --fix repairs what has a mechanical fix, and --diff shows the change first.","Gradual adoption. Profiles choose how much is checked, and a baseline fails the build only on new findings."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jdx/jactionlint/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bc08a48aecb4da14daf5eafd3db89e6e4a3020c8abd3361d3dd907d796e1d094","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.189Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.189Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Catch broken and insecure GitHub Actions workflows before they run.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jdx/jactionlint/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"bc08a48aecb4da14daf5eafd3db89e6e4a3020c8abd3361d3dd907d796e1d094","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jdx/jactionlint/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.189Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-14T18:32:52Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jdx/jactionlint/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.190Z","hash":"bc08a48aecb4da14daf5eafd3db89e6e4a3020c8abd3361d3dd907d796e1d094","originalBytes":12893,"storedBytes":12893,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["jactionlint","run","actions","test.yaml","permissions","profile","checks","checkout","fix","default","findings","install","rule","echo","github","rules","uses","what","actionlint","correctness","it.","only","set","when","workflows","zizmor","commit.message","concurrency","github.event.head","how","jdx","main","push","repository","security","test","token","which","workflow","branch","build","commit","covers","every","fail","false","file","finding","message","new","read","under","action","applies","audits","baseline","because","check","config","diff","documentation","each","first","ignore","image","instead","job","jobs","matrix.os","mise","needs","pass","persist-credentials","policy","profiles","pull","release","reports","request","runs-on","same","shows